title: "LGD-Eval — Independent Evaluation for the Age of Autonomous Agents"
abstract: "Independent third-party evaluation institution for autonomous systems, tools, skills and agents. Evaluates autonomy and verifies governance claims with evidence-grade conclusions, bias-controlled LLM judging, and mappings to OWASP/NIST/ISO/MITRE/EU AI Act standards. / 凡自治之物的独立中立评测机构：以证据分级结论、偏倚可控的判官体系与标准映射，评测自治之物，验证治理主张。"
